#  Laptop Configuration & Pricing Management System

A full-stack MERN application 
---

##  Live Demo

**Frontend:**  
https://assignment-frontend-ten-zeta.vercel.app/

**Backend API:**  
https://assignment-alpha-roan.vercel.app/

---

##  Features

-  JWT Authentication (Register & Login)
-  Category Management (CRUD)
-  Component Management (CRUD)
-  Laptop Configuration Builder
-  Automatic Price Calculation
-  Component-wise Price Breakdown
-  Generate Customer Quotations
-  Historical Pricing Preservation
-  Search Configurations
-  Responsive User Interface

---

##  Technology Stack

### Frontend

- React.js
- React Router DOM
- Bootstrap 5
- Axios
- Context API
- Vite

### Backend

- Node.js
- Express.js
- JWT Authentication
- bcrypt
- Mongoose

### Database

- MongoDB Atlas

### Deployment

- Frontend – Vercel
- Backend – Render
- Database – MongoDB Atlas

---

