---

##  Installation

### Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/khushipatil1523/Assignment.git
```

---

### Backend Setup

```bash
cd backend
npm install
```

Create a `.env` file

```env
PORT=5000
MONGODB_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key
```

Run backend

```bash
npm run dev
```

---

### Frontend Setup

```bash
cd frontend
npm install
```

Create a `.env` file

```env
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
```

Run frontend

```bash
npm run dev
```

---

##  REST APIs

### Authentication

- POST `/api/auth/register`
- POST `/api/auth/login`

### Categories

- GET `/api/categories`
- POST `/api/categories`
- PUT `/api/categories/:id`
- DELETE `/api/categories/:id`

### Components

- GET `/api/components`
- POST `/api/components`
- PUT `/api/components/:id`
- DELETE `/api/components/:id`

### Configurations

- GET `/api/configurations`
- GET `/api/configurations?search=`
- POST `/api/configurations`
- PUT `/api/configurations/:id`
- DELETE `/api/configurations/:id`

### Pricing

- GET `/api/pricing/:configurationId`

### Quotations

- GET `/api/quotations`
- POST `/api/quotations`
- GET `/api/quotations/:id`

---

##  Application Workflow

```
Register/Login
      │
      ▼
Create Categories
      │
      ▼
Create Components
      │
      ▼
Build Laptop Configuration
      │
      ▼
Calculate Pricing
      │
      ▼
Generate Quotation
      │
      ▼
View Historical Quotations
```

